EXCLUSIONS

Referenced third-party photographs, playfield artwork, manuals, videos,
trademarks, and external websites are not relicensed by this repository.
Image metadata includes each asset's separate rights status. An external
image URL is not permission to redistribute or modify the image. Included
image files must have a documented license and permission evidence in
their machine's image.json. Machine facts and identifiers are retained for
interoperability; this notice does not claim exclusive rights over facts.

Source citations identify evidence, not an endorsement or transfer of
copyright. Do not treat a linked source as CC BY-SA unless that source
independently states that license.
